  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Building a strong entrepreneurial ecosystem in the Delta region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the entrepreneurial ecosystem in Egypt&apos;s Nile Delta region by fostering collaboration among key local actors, including universities, incubators, non-governmental organisations (NGOs), private sector representatives, and government entities.Building on the Orange Corners Egypt programme and previous interventions in Cairo and Upper Egypt, the initiative will facilitate creating a shared vision on key barriers entrepreneurs experience, co-creation workshops to develop pathways for improvement, and a regional roundtable.The goal is to create a shared agenda and actionable partnerships that support young entrepreneurs in the Delta.</narrative>
  </description>
